  "_about": "Commands Touch ID calls risky (features/code_touchid.py RISKY) and the window's same table (web/features/code-touchid.js), checked against both by tests/test_code_touchid_proof.py and tests/web/code-touchid.test.mjs. Round 2 R2-8 added a program's folder or quotes, options in any order and interpreter one-liners that delete. Round 3 S3-6 added what a shell reads as the same program (a backslash, quotes inside a word, ${IFS}) and a program known only when it runs (a variable's, $'…'); S3-9 added the programs that run a file or script the session can write (make, npm run, cargo run, docker, gh, uv, java). Item 49 (Windows parity) added PowerShell's and cmd's own: Remove-Item -Recurse, rd /s, del /f, format, the registry, scheduled tasks, services, iwr | iex, -EncodedCommand, certutil/bitsadmin downloads, and their shells as programs that run anything.",
